# A core whose state holds something of its host: console 1's carries a
# digest of its save directory's path (link_test_mode host_stamp), which is
# another in every run, as a real core's may carry its host's clock. Its
# pictures and audio repeat, and its S field does in no run that starts a
# new machine: compare-fresh VA leaves S out for the frames such a machine
# runs. From a load on S is compared, since the state brings the first
# run's digest back.
compare-fresh VA
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
option 1 link_test_mode host_stamp
0 cable 0:0 1:0
40 save mid
60 checkpoint later
80 end
